  "author": "Xleth",
  "description": "The shipped default. Surfaces and text sit on the neutral UI-kit ramp (ui/DESIGN.md §3.1): bg-primary=g0, bg-surface=g1, text=ink, text-muted=ink-2, border-subtle=g4; the other derived tokens follow from these. Accent and danger are unchanged. Six of the 16 track-palette entries were adjusted to meet the identity-palette rules (ui/DESIGN.md §3.4).",
